fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gstmpegvideoparser.html#gst_buffer_add_mpeg_video_meta","fragment":"\n\tgst_buffer_add_mpeg_video_meta\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.prototype.buffer_add_mpeg_video_meta\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.buffer_add_mpeg_video_meta\n\nCreates and adds a GstMpegVideoMeta to a buffer.\nProvided structures must either be NULL or GSlice-allocated.\nParameters:\na GstBuffer\na GstMpegVideoSequenceHdr\na GstMpegVideoSequenceExt\na GstMpegVideoSequenceDisplayExt\na GstMpegVideoPictureHdr\na GstMpegVideoPictureExt\na GstMpegVideoQuantMatrixExt\na newly created GstMpegVideoMeta\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.2\n\t\t\nCreates and adds a GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoMeta to a buffer.\nProvided structures must either be null or GSlice-allocated.\nParameters:\na Gst.Buffer\na GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoSequenceHdr\na GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoSequenceExt\na GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoSequenceDisplayExt\na GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoPictureHdr\na GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoPictureExt\na GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoQuantMatrixExt\na newly created GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoMeta\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.2\n\t\t\nCreates and adds a GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoMeta to a buffer.\nProvided structures must either be None or GSlice-allocated.\nParameters:\na Gst.Buffer\na GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoSequenceHdr\na GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoSequenceExt\na GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoSequenceDisplayExt\na GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoPictureHdr\na GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoPictureExt\na GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoQuantMatrixExt\na newly created GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoMeta\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.2\n\t\t\n"});